# VS Code settings (contains credentials)
**/.vscode/

# Claude Code - ignore local settings, track workflow files
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/todos.local.json

# Logs
**/logs/

# dbt artifacts (version-specific lock file)
**/dbt/package-lock.yml

# Windows artifacts
nul

# Power BI local settings (user-specific)
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/editorSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
